ts de Noël qui vous font penser à la fin du trimestre, aux vacances ou aux chapeaux à pompon; des chansons qui font penser à la nourriture, à la neige ou aux cadeaux. Voici quelques-uns des chants de Noël les plus populaires, ainsi que d'autres surprises… Joyeux Noël!","category":"music","restricted":true,"author":"Various","previewAudio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/mon-premier-album-de-noel.mp3","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/c2ac1595563a9857899a22457c1b13c0c963f359d4e88e8fb99f3d76def24d80/vU-WXHkIhT8N-Kyaw2xpa4vad-vsI91iIq-y29oMxkE.mp3","abridged":false,"copyright":"℗ © 2011 Naxos","maxAge":14,"minAge":0,"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/x6-Vn4OWVTZgwg5nC9eciQ4xSWeCtKpckHZDx1wK0AY"},"languages":["fr"],"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2020-12-01T13:59:53.556Z"},"media":{"duration":4517,"fileSize":90270147,"hasStreams":false},"authors":["Various"],"copyrights":["℗ © 2011 Naxos"],"musicTypes":["classical-music"],"narrators":["Various"]},"slug":"mon-premier-album-de-noel","title":"Mon Premier album de Noël","updatedAt":"2026-01-19T16:53:09.462Z","userId":"yoto","clubAvailability":[],"sortkey":"mon-premier-album-de-noel"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}